## Use cases

- A loading or working state on a card, input, search bar, or message composer.
- The wait during a long AI generation (a canvas, an image, a long answer).
- The "searching" state of the CoreBox search bar.

## Related components

- [BorderBeam](/docs/dev/components/border-beam): a beam that travels along or breathes around a border; it draws the border, not cones rising from an edge.
- [ThinkingOrb](/docs/dev/components/thinking-orb): a standalone orb with its own `label`; to light up a card or input that is already there, use PrismGlow.
- [GlowText](/docs/dev/components/glow-text): a shine that sweeps across text or a card.
